[I] Terminal status monitor for Tor

[T] Nyx is a command line monitor for Tor relays and clients written in
[T] Python. It shows bandwidth usage, connections, logs and configuration of
[T] a running Tor process via its control port.

[U] https://nyx.torproject.org/

[A] Nyx Authors
